'''Bonemaw''' are aggressive creatures found in the boiling waters surrounding the [[Ashlands]] landmass. They pose a significant danger when sailing to the biome.

==Drops==
The Bonemaw will drop [[Bonemaw Meat]] and [[Bonemaw Tooth|Bonemaw teeth]] at the site of its death, floating on the surface of the water. The trophy, however, sinks.
