== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Bonemaw|Aggressive creature strategies#Bonemaw Serpent}}

=== Spit ===
Dives slightly before swooping up out of the water to launch a barrage of three fireballs at the player which inflict the [[Burning]] and [[Poison]] statuses (40 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 20 [[Damage types#Fire|Fire]] and 20 [[Damage types#Poison|Poison]] damage for each hit). The fireballs travel at 20 meters per second and can travel for 10 seconds before disappearing, and has a spread of 10–20 degrees. This ability can be used every 20 seconds when within 10–30 meters of a player.

=== Bite ===
Bonemaws will draw their head back before lunging forward to bite the player (140 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] damage). This attack can be used every 10 seconds when within 3 meters of a player; even when a player is within attacking range, Bonemaws will continue moving toward them to stay as close as possible. It extends 3 meters out and hits in an 80-degree horizontal arc.

